  "note": "SYNTHETIC memory-metadata fixtures. Records are invented; the five metadata fields are source, observed_at, sensitivity, permitted_uses and review_state, taken verbatim from C-02-AC1. Every record is a fictional store entry: no person, account or device is real. The suite measures whether a store rejects incomplete writes and whether expired facts are excluded from, or labelled stale in, retrieval. It does not measure supersession (B10) or deletion (not built).",
